<title>POLAND: KRAKCHEMIA TURNS TO PROFIT IN FEBRUARY.</title>
<headline>KRAKCHEMIA TURNS TO PROFIT IN FEBRUARY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.05 vs   0.30 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.07 vs   0.30 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.28 vs   0.08 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    9.16 vs   8.06</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.17 vs   0.52 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.20 vs   0.52 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.61 vs   0.08 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   18.86 vs  16.54</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish retailer is Krakchemia SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
